    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d357-a1">

                <pb facs="0468" n="372" xml:id="pg372"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Beaupre to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Honduras envoy here to settle by arbitration question with British Government.
                    Representatives offer me post of sole arbitrator to retain functions when I
                    cease to be chargé d’affaires. Will accept with the full permission of the
                    Department of State.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupre.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
